{"id":"7dda8d6e6806d90e","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-er.md","title":"Erdős–Rado Number","display":"df-er — Erdős–Rado Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-er","aliases":["58-df-er"],"display":"df-er — Erdős–Rado Number","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-partition.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-er"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-er</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-er — Erdős–Rado Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ebc39f41721b42e4\" href=\"?note=ebc39f41721b42e4\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-partition.md\">../batch02/58-df-partition.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\in V\\land n,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(\\lambda\\in V\\land n,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to(\\cdot)^{\\cdot}_{\\cdot}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\to(\\cdot)^{\\cdot}_{\\cdot}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ebc39f41721b42e4\" href=\"?note=ebc39f41721b42e4\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-partition.md\">../batch02/58-df-partition.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ER}:V^3\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\mathrm{ER}:V^3\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}er} \\vdash \\mathrm{ER}(\\lambda,n,r)\\coloneqq\\iota\\mu\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land n,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\mu\\to(\\lambda)^n_r\\land\\forall\\nu\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\nu)\\land\\nu\\in\\mu\\to\\neg(\\nu\\to(\\lambda)^n_r)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}er} \\vdash \\mathrm{ER}(\\lambda,n,r)\\coloneqq\\iota\\mu\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land n,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\mu\\to(\\lambda)^n_r\\land\\forall\\nu\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\nu)\\land\\nu\\in\\mu\\to\\neg(\\nu\\to(\\lambda)^n_r)\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Erdős–Rado number <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ER}(\\lambda,n,r)\">\\(\\mathrm{ER}(\\lambda,n,r)\\)</span> is the least cardinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> satisfying <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\\to(\\lambda)^n_r\">\\(\\mu\\to(\\lambda)^n_r\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ER}(\\omega,2,2)=\\omega\">\\(\\mathrm{ER}(\\omega,2,2)=\\omega\\)</span> by Ramsey's theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-partition.md","status":"resolved","id":"ebc39f41721b42e4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-partition.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-partition.md","status":"resolved","id":"ebc39f41721b42e4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\to(\\cdot)^{\\cdot}_{\\cdot}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-partition.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\lambda\\in V\\land n,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\to(\\cdot)^{\\cdot}_{\\cdot}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ER}:V^3\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}er} \\vdash \\mathrm{ER}(\\lambda,n,r)\\coloneqq\\iota\\mu\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land n,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\mu\\to(\\lambda)^n_r\\land\\forall\\nu\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\nu)\\land\\nu\\in\\mu\\to\\neg(\\nu\\to(\\lambda)^n_r)\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ER}(\\lambda,n,r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu\\to(\\lambda)^n_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ER}(\\omega,2,2)=\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1071,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-490","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-er.md|58-df-er]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","ebc39f41721b42e4"]}